# agtsmith Python Core

- Splunk MCP calls must pass deterministic `query_policy` before execution
- Parse MCP `result.structuredContent` as primary data; `content` is status text
- Match upstream style: explicit prompts, no filler comments
- Read-only Splunk — no write/delete tools in automated paths
